/-!
# Transport of the standard nonvanishing into the ambient category

The nonvanishing of the standard super object carried into any
ambient symmetric ℂ-linear category with an odd invertible line, in
the three parts below: the Koszul sign of a permutation of slot
labels ([Signs.lean](SuperEmbed/Signs.lean)), the letter systems
that make the action of the group algebra model independent
([Letters.lean](SuperEmbed/Letters.lean)), and the two systems and
the conclusion they force
([Standard.lean](SuperEmbed/Standard.lean)).
